      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Create a new <a href=\"BasicMapId.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.mapping\"><code>BasicMapId</code></a> given a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Map</code></a> of key-value tuples.",
      "translation": "根据一个键值对 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Map</code></a> 创建一个新的<a href=\"BasicMapId.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.mapping\"><code>BasicMapId</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Create a new and empty <a href=\"BasicMapId.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.mapping\"><code>BasicMapId</code></a>.",
      "translation": "创建一个新的且空的<a href=\"BasicMapId.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.mapping 中的类\"><code>BasicMapId</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Builder method that adds the value for the named property, then returns <code>this</code>.",
      "translation": "用于添加指定属性值的方法，然后返回<code>this</code>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<em>Note:</em> This could be extended in various cool ways, like one that takes a type and validates that the given\nname corresponds to an actual field or bean property on that type. There could also be another one that uses a\n<a href=\"CassandraPersistentEntity.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.mapping\"><code>CassandraPersistentEntity</code></a> and <a href=\"CassandraPersistentProperty.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.mapping\"><code>CassandraPersistentProperty</code></a> instead of a String name.",
      "translation": "<em>注意：</em>这可以以各种有趣的方式扩展，例如一种接受类型并验证给定名称是否对应于该类型的实际字段或 Bean 属性的方法。还可以有另一种方法，使用<a href=\"CassandraPersistentEntity.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.mapping\"><code>CassandraPersistentEntity</code></a>和<a href=\"CassandraPersistentProperty.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.mapping\"><code>CassandraPersistentProperty</code></a>代替字符串名称。",
      "count": 1
    },
